{
  "id": "halcyon_tower",
  "title": "Halcyon Tower",
  "premise": "Floors 50 to 52 of a glass skyscraper in the financial district belong to Halcyon Biologics, and Halcyon Biologics belongs to a weapons programme. Specimen K-7 has been floating in its tank for eight months, listening. Tonight the ductwork is still charged with nerve agent from the last containment drill, and the night shift is thin.",
  "design_notes": "Route A (the doctor's face, fastest): absorb Dr. Vasquez when she checks the tank on turn 3 (the tank camera puts the alarm at 2), badge out with her card, wear her face through the lab, con Officer Chen into opening the express elevator and ride down to the street; one more slip takes the alarm to 3 and locks the elevator. Route B (ductwork): ooze from the tank into the HVAC plant (one dose of nerve agent, a second dose kills), absorb technician Okoro, take over the duct terminal and flush the air, then ooze through the break room into the CEO's office for the master key; finish quietly by opening the stairwell duct, or loudly by sprinting through the lobby to the roof before the purge. Route C (phishing): as Vasquez, log into the lab terminal and phish the CEO's phone for the security password, absorb Officer Reyes for his keycard, and unlock the roof hatch from the security hub. Dangers: two armed guards sweep the lobby, cameras on the tank, corridor, lobby and elevator, nerve agent in the vents, elevator lockout at alarm 3, the purge at full lockdown, turn limit 26.",
  "turn_limit": 26,
